      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "911_Memorial",
      "label": "9/11 Memorial and Museum",
      "description": "A memorial site in New York City dedicated to the victims of the 9/11 attacks, which serves as a place of remembrance and reflection. The reference to '911' in the meme implicitly connects to this site and the collective memory it represents.",
